---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Super Smash Bros. Ultimate — The Party Game That Never Leaves the Shelf"
  description="A buying guide for Super Smash Bros. Ultimate on Switch: fighters, DLC, and where to buy cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Super Smash Bros. Ultimate — The Party Game That Never Leaves the Shelf</h1>
    <p class="meta">Nintendo Switch · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Super Smash Bros. Ultimate</strong> is the definitive entry in Nintendo's
      mascot fighter, with the largest roster in the series and local multiplayer that
      works for everyone from kids to competitive players.
    </p>

    <h2>What's in the box</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Base game</strong> — every fighter from series history, plus a story mode</li>
      <li><strong>Fighter Pass / DLC</strong> — adds guest characters (Joker, Banjo, Sora and more); buy only the ones you want</li>
      <li><strong>Physical vs digital</strong> — digital means no cartridge to lose at a party; physical holds trade value</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Is the DLC worth it?</h2>
    <p>
      The base roster is enormous, so you don't need any DLC to enjoy it. Pick up
      individual fighters only if a specific character matters to you. The full Fighter
      Pass is for completists, not newcomers.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Super+Smash+Bros+Ultimate+Switch"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
